---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Page title="Privacy notice" path="/privacy/" description="What personal information Long Paddock collects, why, and your choices." kicker="Legal">
  <p>This notice explains what information Long Paddock, published by Tourground, collects when you use this site and what we do with it.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Browsing.</strong> This site does not use analytics, advertising trackers or cookies. Our hosting provider, Vercel, processes standard request data such as IP addresses in server logs to deliver the site and keep it secure.</li>
    <li><strong>Email sign-up.</strong> If you sign up for email updates, you send us an email from your own mail app. We keep your email address on our list so we can send you Long Paddock updates.</li>
    <li><strong>Messages.</strong> If you write to us, we keep your message and address to reply and to deal with any correction.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>We use your email address only to send Long Paddock updates and to answer you. We do not sell it or share it with operators or advertisers.</p>
  <h2>Leaving the list and your rights</h2>
  <p>Reply to any email or write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> to unsubscribe, or to ask to see, correct or delete the information we hold about you. We aim to respond within 30 days.</p>
  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>Stories link to official websites and to operators in the Tourground directory. Those sites have their own privacy policies.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If we change this notice, we will update the date at the top of the page.</p>
</Page>
